<url><loc>https://aiforseries.github.io/skits/bhanja-chatgpt/</loc><lastmod>2026-11-23</lastmod><image:image><image:loc>https://aiforseries.github.io/covers/skit-01-bhanja-chatgpt.jpg</image:loc></image:image><video:video><video:thumbnail_loc>https://aiforseries.github.io/covers/skit-01-bhanja-chatgpt.jpg</video:thumbnail_loc><video:title>Har CA ke client ka ek ChatGPT wala bhanja hota hai</video:title><video:description>Raat 11:47. Sharma ji: "Ek baat puchni thi." Bhanja engineering kar raha hai, ChatGPT pe check kar liya, return file karna toh 10 minute ka kaam hai. Phir yeh paanch hazaar...? CA comedy: ITR filing, AIS aur client ka bhanja.</video:description><video:player_loc>https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/WAeZHbjfpUo</video:player_loc><video:duration>50</video:duration><video:publication_date>2026-11-23T22:25:55+05:30</video:publication_date><video:family_friendly>yes</video:family_friendly></video:video></url>
<url><loc>https://aiforseries.github.io/skits/night-before-exam/</loc><lastmod>2026-11-25</lastmod><image:image><image:loc>https://aiforseries.github.io/covers/02-night-before-exam.jpg</image:loc></image:image><video:video><video:thumbnail_loc>https://aiforseries.github.io/covers/02-night-before-exam.jpg</video:thumbnail_loc><video:title>ChatGPT: 4.2 lakh. ICAI: 3.85 lakh. Exam: kal.</video:title><video:description>Raat 1:12. Ankit ke paas ek sum hai, do answers hain, aur paper kal hai. Dost ka bhi. Funny Short for CA Inter students: ChatGPT vs ICAI solution.</video:description><video:player_loc>https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/F0VJslXK07A</video:player_loc><video:duration>29</video:duration><video:publication_date>2026-11-25T19:00:00+05:30</video:publication_date><video:family_friendly>yes</video:family_friendly></video:video></url>
<url><loc>https://aiforseries.github.io/skits/bhanja-gst/</loc><lastmod>2026-11-26</lastmod><image:image><image:loc>https://aiforseries.github.io/covers/05-bhanja-gst.jpg</image:loc></image:image><video:video><video:thumbnail_loc>https://aiforseries.github.io/covers/05-bhanja-gst.jpg</video:thumbnail_loc><video:title>Bhanja Returns: ab GST bhi ChatGPT se</video:title><video:description>Sharma ji wapas aaye hain. Is baar bhanje ne GST return ChatGPT se file kar diya, aur "ek chhota sa issue" hai. Bhanja kahan hai, yeh mat poochiye. CA comedy, part 2: GST return, 2B, 3B aur ITC mismatch.</video:description><video:player_loc>https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/RyhUZHA2O_Y</video:player_loc><video:duration>43</video:duration><video:publication_date>2026-11-26T19:00:00+05:30</video:publication_date><video:family_friendly>yes</video:family_friendly></video:video></url>
